  "summary_en": "Japan's non-binding soft-law AI Guidelines for Business (Ver1.2, March 2026), issued by MIC and METI. They set common guiding principles and role-specific duties for AI developers, providers and business users, using a risk-based, goal-based approach, and promote AI governance building. Mentions cyber-physical systems but is largely general AI.",
