   "Non-binding goal-based soft law integrating earlier MIC and METI AI guidelines",
   "Common guiding principles: human-centric, safety, fairness, privacy, security, transparency, accountability",
   "Separate duties for AI developers, AI providers and AI business users",
   "Risk-based approach scaling measures to impact and probability of harm",
   "Encourages building AI governance and follows Hiroshima Process International Guiding Principles"
